sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor F as Facilitator
  participant UI as UI (ui.js)
  participant C as Core (core.js)
  participant S as PlanStore
  participant E as SyncEngine
  participant API as Sync server
  participant DB as plans.json
  F->>UI: Mark complete and send
  UI->>C: markComplete(plan)
  alt missing date / safety / inclusion
    C-->>UI: errors[]
    UI-->>F: error summary, focus moved, fields marked invalid
  else valid
    C-->>UI: [] (state COMPLETE, sync PENDING, new editId)
    UI->>S: put(plan) – encrypt + single write
    UI->>E: runOnce()
    alt no signal
      E-->>UI: offline – stays "Waiting for signal"
    else signal
      E->>API: PUT /api/plans/id  If-Match: baseRev {plan, editId}
      API->>C: validatePlan + field whitelist
      alt same editId already stored
        API-->>E: 200 {rev, replay:true} – no duplicate
      else If-Match = current rev
        API->>DB: write tmp, rename
        API-->>E: 201/200 {rev}
        E->>S: SYNCHRONISED, baseRev = rev
        UI-->>F: "Sent to outreach unit hh:mm" + live announcement
      else server copy changed
        API-->>E: 412 {server copy}
        E->>S: CONFLICT, keep both copies
        UI-->>F: "Needs your choice" → Choose a version
      end
    end
  end
